This project includes Rust adaptations of portions of ezf3d.

Upstream: https://github.com/AlexSabaka/ezf3d
Version: 0.1.1
Reference commit: 97fe90ab8c39c3978fa6354f4a21c5ebdbc38c6e
License: MIT
